---
description: Keep Nexus docs in sync when changing config, orchestration, or runner APIs
globs:
  - nexus/config/**
  - nexus/orchestration/**
  - nexus/runner/**
  - nexus/multiagent/**
  - examples/**
  - .env.example
---

When editing Nexus configuration models, orchestration schema, or runner/orchestrator APIs:

1. Update the matching page under `docs/reference/` (parameter tables: Name, Required?, Default, What it does).
2. Update annotated examples in `docs/assets/` if signatures or defaults changed.
3. Follow beginner-friendly rules in `docs/style-guide.md` and the sync table in `AGENTS.md`.
4. Keep `README.md` lean; put new detail in `docs/`, not README.
